/*
 * Implements semantic validation for tuple field access in Ymir.
 *
 * Supported forms:
 *   - tupleExpr.N        (compile-time constant index)
 *   - tupleExpr.($ - N)  (index computed via $ inside tuple context)
 *
 *
 * This module is invoked by FieldValidation when the left operand is a tuple.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::operator::fields::tuple
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/operator/fields/tuple.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-04-07
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
